     99367.,      !- Barometric Pressure {Pa}
        2.8,      !- Wind Speed {m/s} design conditions vs. traditional 3.35 m/s (7mph)
        290,      !- Wind Direction {Degrees; N=0, S=180}
         No,      !- Rain {Yes/No}
         No,      !- Snow on ground {Yes/No}
         No,      !- Daylight Savings Time Indicator
